{
 "schema_version": "1",
 "description": "Business records of job_pilot. Each table has ONE owner agent (the only writer). The SQLite tables of app/instance/job_pilot.db are created from this file (app/agent/__init__.py: ensure_business_tables). Supervision tables (sup_runs, sup_tasks, llm_calls, incidents, events, skills, approvals...) come from app/agent/supervision.py.",
